function Login({onLogin}:{onLogin:(token:string,b:Bootstrap)=>void}){const [username,setUsername]=useState('');const [password,setPassword]=useState('');const [error,setError]=useState('');async function submit(e:React.FormEvent){e.preventDefault();setError('');try{const x=await request('/authenticate-user',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({username,password})});const b=await request('/ui/bootstrap',{},x.sessionToken);onLogin(x.sessionToken,b)}catch(e){setError((e as Error).message)}}return <main className="auth"><form onSubmit={submit} className="card login"><div className="brand">LAB<span>FLOW</span></div><h1>Sample logistics</h1><p className="muted">Secure pickup, custody, and laboratory delivery</p><label htmlFor="username">Username</label><input id="username" value={username} onChange={e=>setUsername(e.target.value)} autoComplete="username" required/><label htmlFor="password">Password</label><input id="password" type="password" value={password} onChange={e=>setPassword(e.target.value)} autoComplete="current-password" required/>{error&&<div className="error" role="alert">Invalid credentials or unavailable service</div>}<button type="submit">Sign in</button></form></main>}
function App(){const [token,setToken]=useState(localStorage.getItem('lab-token')||'');const [boot,setBoot]=useState<Bootstrap|null>(null);const [tab,setTab]=useState('overview');const [notice,setNotice]=useState('');const [audit,setAudit]=useState<any[]>([]);useEffect(()=>{if(token){request('/ui/bootstrap',{},token).then(setBoot).catch(()=>{localStorage.removeItem('lab-token');setToken('')})}},[token]);if(!token||!boot)return <Login onLogin={(t,b)=>{localStorage.setItem('lab-token',t);setToken(t);setBoot(b)}}/>;const refresh=()=>request('/ui/bootstrap',{},token).then(setBoot);async function role(e:React.ChangeEvent<HTMLSelectElement>){try{await request('/select-active-role',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({role:e.target.value})},token);await refresh()}catch(e){setNotice((e as Error).message)}}async function audits(){try{const x=await request('/search-audit-trail',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({limit:50,order:'newest_first'})},token);setAudit(x.entries)}catch(e){setNotice((e as Error).message)}}function signout(){localStorage.removeItem('lab-token');setToken('');setBoot(null)}return <div className="shell"><header><div className="brand">LAB<span>FLOW</span></div><div className="header-right"><label htmlFor="role">Working as</label><select id="role" value={boot.user.activeRole||''} onChange={role}>{boot.user.roles.map(r=><option key={r} value={r}>{r.replaceAll('_',' ')}</option>)}</select><button className="ghost" onClick={signout}>Sign out</button></div></header><div className="layout"><aside><div className="profile"><div className="avatar">{(boot.user.fullName||boot.user.username).slice(0,1).toUpperCase()}</div><strong>{boot.user.fullName||boot.user.username}</strong><small>{boot.user.activeRole.replaceAll('_',' ')}</small></div><nav aria-label="Primary navigation">{[['overview','Overview'],['work','My work'],['samples','Samples'],['map','Live map'],['audit','Audit history']].map(([id,label])=><button key={id} className={tab===id?'selected':''} onClick={()=>{setTab(id);if(id==='audit')audits()}}>{label}</button>)}</nav><div className="side-foot">Network online<br/><span>Last sync {new Date(boot.serverTime).toLocaleTimeString()}</span></div></aside><main className="content"><div className="page-head"><div><p className="eyebrow">CONTROL CENTER</p><h1>{tab==='overview'?'Good to see you':tab[0].toUpperCase()+tab.slice(1)}</h1><p className="muted">Track every handoff from collection to receipt.</p></div><div className="status-pill"><i/> All systems operational</div></div>{notice&&<div className="notice">{notice}</div>}{tab==='overview'&&<Overview boot={boot} onRefresh={refresh}/>} {tab==='work'&&<Work token={token} boot={boot}/>} {tab==='samples'&&<Samples boot={boot} token={token}/>} {tab==='map'&&<LiveMap operations={boot.operations}/>} {tab==='audit'&&<Audit entries={audit}/>}</main></div></div>}
function Overview({boot,onRefresh}:{boot:Bootstrap;onRefresh:()=>void}){const o=boot.operations||{};const samples=o.samples||[];return <><section className="metrics"><Metric label="Active samples" value={samples.filter((x:any)=>!['received','cancelled'].includes(x.status)).length} tone="teal"/><Metric label="Awaiting collection" value={samples.filter((x:any)=>x.status==='awaiting_collection').length} tone="amber"/><Metric label="Exceptions" value={(o.exceptions||[]).length} tone="red"/><Metric label="Workers online" value={(o.workers||[]).filter((x:any)=>x.available).length} tone="purple"/></section><div className="grid-2"><section className="card panel"><div className="panel-head"><h2>Sample activity</h2><button className="link" onClick={onRefresh}>Refresh</button></div>{samples.length?<div className="table">{samples.slice(0,6).map((x:any)=><div className="row" key={x.sampleId}><div><strong>{x.sampleId.slice(0,8)}…</strong><small>{x.status.replaceAll('_',' ')}</small></div><span className={x.locationStale?'tag stale':'tag'}>{x.locationStale?'Location stale':'Tracking live'}</span></div>)}</div>:<Empty text="No samples are currently in the network."/>}</section><section className="card panel"><h2>Network health</h2><div className="health"><div><span className="health-num">{(o.locations||[]).length}</span><small>Locations</small></div><div><span className="health-num">{(o.connections||[]).length}</span><small>Connections</small></div><div><span className="health-num">{o.assignmentCountSpread||0}</span><small>Workload spread</small></div></div><div className="mini-map">LOCAL PMTILES MAP<br/><span>Routes and custody locations</span></div></section></div></>}
function Metric({label,value,tone}:{label:string;value:number;tone:string}){return <div className={`card metric ${tone}`}><small>{label}</small><strong>{value}</strong><span>updated just now</span></div>};function Empty({text}:{text:string}){return <div className="empty">{text}</div>}
function Work({token,boot}:{token:string;boot:Bootstrap}){const [work,setWork]=useState<any>(null);useEffect(()=>{request('/list-role-work',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({})},token).then(setWork)},[token]);return <section className="card panel"><div className="panel-head"><div><h2>My current work</h2><p className="muted">Role: {boot.user.activeRole.replaceAll('_',' ')}</p></div></div>{!work||(!work.pending.length&&!work.inProgress.length&&!work.completed.length)?<Empty text="No assignments are currently scoped to this role."/>:<><h3>Pending</h3>{work.pending.map((x:any)=><div className="work-row" key={x.assignmentId}><b>{x.kind}</b><span>{x.sampleId.slice(0,8)}…</span><em>{x.status}</em></div>)}</>}</section>}
function Samples({boot,token}:{boot:Bootstrap;token:string}){const items=boot.requesterSamples||boot.operations?.samples||[];const [selected,setSelected]=useState<any>(null);return <section className="card panel"><div className="panel-head"><h2>Samples</h2><span className="muted">{items.length} visible to your role</span></div>{items.length?<div className="sample-grid">{items.map((x:any)=><button className="sample-card" key={x.sampleId} onClick={()=>request('/read-sample-state/'+x.sampleId,{},token).then(setSelected)}><strong>Sample {x.sampleId.slice(0,8)}…</strong><span>{x.status.replaceAll('_',' ')}</span><small>{x.locationStale?'Last location is stale':'Location current'}</small></button>)}</div>:<Empty text="No samples are visible yet."/>}{selected&&<div className="detail"><h3>Sample status</h3><p><b>{selected.state.status}</b> · {selected.locationStale?'Location stale':'Location fresh'}</p><h4>Status timeline</h4>{selected.timeline.map((x:any)=><div className="timeline" key={x.eventId}><i/><span>{x.action.replaceAll('_',' ')}</span><small>{new Date(x.occurredAt).toLocaleString()}</small></div>)}</div>}</section>}
function LiveMap({operations}:{operations:any}){return <section className="card panel map-panel"><div className="map-placeholder"><div className="map-label">LIVE NETWORK MAP</div><p>MapLibre · local PMTiles</p>{(operations?.locations||[]).map((x:any)=><div className="map-marker" key={x.id} title={x.name}>●</div>)}</div><div className="map-legend"><h2>Network locations</h2>{(operations?.locations||[]).map((x:any)=><div className="legend-row" key={x.id}><i className={x.active?'dot live':'dot'}/><span>{x.name}</span><small>{Object.keys(x.functions||{}).filter(k=>x.functions[k]).join(' · ')}</small></div>)}</div></section>}
function Audit({entries}:{entries:any[]}){return <section className="card panel"><div className="panel-head"><h2>Audit history</h2><span className="muted">Searchable durable events</span></div>{entries.length?<div className="audit-list">{entries.map(x=><div className="audit-row" key={x.auditId}><span className="audit-icon">✓</span><div><strong>{x.action.replaceAll('_',' ')}</strong><small>{x.entityType} · {x.entityId.slice(0,12)}</small></div><time>{new Date(x.occurredAt).toLocaleString()}</time></div>)}</div>:<Empty text="No audit events match the current search."/>}</section>}
createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(<App/>);
EOF

